        '[UPSC: Prelims-GS1, Mains-GS1] [KAS: Prelims-P1, Mains-GS1] [SSC: GA]', 'Paleography and epigraphic evolution: Brahmi script (mother of most Indian and Southeast Asian writing systems, deciphered by James Prinsep in 1837 for Ashokan edicts, written left-to-right), Kharosthi script (Aramaic-derived, written right-to-left in northwestern Gandhara), development of Gupta script, Siddhamatrika, Nagari/Devanagari, and Southern Grantha/Kadamba scripts.', ARRAY['Brahmi Script Decipherment (James Prinsep 1837)', 'Kharosthi Right-to-Left Script', 'Ashokan Inscriptions Epigraphy', 'Devanagari Evolution', 'Grantha & Kadamba Scripts']::text[], ARRAY['Evolution', 'Ancient', 'Indian', 'Scripts', 'Brahmi', 'Kharosthi', 'Paleography', 'epigraphic', 'evolution', 'script', 'mother', 'most', 'Southeast', 'Asian', 'writing', 'systems', 'deciphered', 'James', 'Prinsep', '1837', 'Ashokan', 'edicts', 'written', 'left', 'right', 'Aramaic', 'derived', 'northwestern', 'Gandhara', 'development', 'Gupta', 'Siddhamatrika', 'Nagari', 'Devanagari', 'Southern', 'Grantha', 'Kadamba', 'scripts', 'Script', 'Decipherment', 'Right', 'Left', 'Inscriptions', 'Epigraphy']::text[],
