        '[KAS: Prelims-P1, Mains-GS1] [UPSC: Prelims-GS1, Mains-GS1]', 'Karnataka''s premier crafts awarded Geographical Indication (GI) status: Channapatna wooden lacquer toys (Gombe made from soft Wrightia tinctoria / Aale mara wood, patronized originally by Tipu Sultan), Bidriware (intricate silver inlay on blackened zinc-copper alloy from Bidar), Mysore Silk (pure mulberry silk with gold zari), Ilkal Sarees (featuring distinctive red Tope Teni pallu and Kasuti embroidery), Sandalwood Carvings, Kinnal Wooden Craft, and Guledgudd Khana.', ARRAY['Channapatna Lacquerware Toys (GI)', 'Bidriware Silver Inlay (GI)', 'Mysore Silk & Zari Weaving (GI)', 'Ilkal Sarees & Tope Teni Pallu (GI)', 'Kinnal Wooden Toys & Idols', 'Sandalwood Carving Heritage']::text[], ARRAY['GI', 'Tagged', 'Handicrafts', 'Handlooms', 'Karnataka', 'premier', 'crafts', 'awarded', 'Geographical', 'Indication', 'status', 'Channapatna', 'wooden', 'lacquer', 'toys', 'Gombe', 'made', 'soft', 'Wrightia', 'tinctoria', 'Aale', 'mara', 'wood', 'patronized', 'originally', 'Tipu', 'Sultan', 'Bidriware', 'intricate', 'silver', 'inlay', 'blackened', 'zinc', 'copper', 'alloy', 'Bidar', 'Mysore', 'Silk', 'pure', 'mulberry', 'silk', 'gold', 'zari', 'Ilkal', 'Sarees', 'featuring', 'distinctive', 'red', 'Tope', 'Teni', 'pallu', 'Kasuti', 'embroidery', 'Sandalwood', 'Carvings', 'Kinnal', 'Wooden', 'Craft', 'Guledgudd', 'Khana', 'Lacquerware', 'Toys', 'Silver', 'Inlay', 'Zari', 'Weaving', 'Pallu', 'Idols', 'Carving', 'Heritage']::text[],
