        '[UPSC: Prelims-GS1, Mains-GS1] [KAS: Prelims-P1, Mains-GS1] [SSC: GA]', 'Seven major and minor tectonic plates (Pacific, North American, Eurasian, African, Indo-Australian, South American, Antarctic, Nazca, Cocos, Arabian); Plate boundaries: Divergent constructive (Mid-Atlantic Ridge, East African Great Rift Valley), Convergent destructive (Oceanic-Continental forming Andes, Oceanic-Oceanic forming Mariana trench and island arcs, Continental-Continental collision forming Himalayas), and Transform conservative faults (San Andreas Fault California); Pacific Ring of Fire harboring 75% of active volcanoes and 90% of global earthquakes.', ARRAY['Major and Minor Tectonic Plates', 'Divergent Boundaries (Rift Valleys)', 'Convergent Boundaries (Subduction Zones)', 'Himalayan Continental Collision', 'Transform Faults (San Andreas)', 'Pacific Ring of Fire Subduction']::text[], ARRAY['Plate', 'Boundaries', 'Convergent', 'Divergent', 'Transform', 'Ring', 'Fire', 'Seven', 'major', 'minor', 'tectonic', 'plates', 'Pacific', 'North', 'American', 'Eurasian', 'African', 'Indo', 'Australian', 'South', 'Antarctic', 'Nazca', 'Cocos', 'Arabian', 'boundaries', 'constructive', 'Mid', 'Atlantic', 'Ridge', 'East', 'Great', 'Rift', 'Valley', 'destructive', 'Oceanic', 'Continental', 'forming', 'Andes', 'Mariana', 'trench', 'island', 'arcs', 'collision', 'Himalayas', 'conservative', 'faults', 'San', 'Andreas', 'Fault', 'California', 'harboring', '75%', 'active', 'volcanoes', '90%', 'global', 'earthquakes', 'Major', 'Minor', 'Tectonic', 'Plates', 'Valleys', 'Subduction', 'Zones', 'Himalayan', 'Collision', 'Faults']::text[],
