        'geography_earth_systems.climatology_atmospheric_dynamics.atmosphere_structure_heat_budget.temperature_inversion_phenomena_and_types', 'temperature_inversion_phenomena_and_types', 'Temperature Inversion: Radiation, Advection & Valley Belts', 4,
        'Subtopic_Entity', 'Geography & Earth Systems', 'geography_earth_systems', 'geography_earth_systems.climatology_atmospheric_dynamics.atmosphere_structure_heat_budget',
        ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY['geography_earth_systems', 'geography_earth_systems.climatology_atmospheric_dynamics', 'geography_earth_systems.climatology_atmospheric_dynamics.atmosphere_structure_heat_budget']::text[], '{"upsc": ["Prelims-GS1", "Mains-GS1"], "kas": ["Prelims-P1", "Mains-GS1"], "ssc": ["GA"]}'::jsonb,
        '[UPSC: Prelims-GS1, Mains-GS1] [KAS: Prelims-P1, Mains-GS1] [SSC: GA]', 'Reversal of normal lapse rate where temperature increases with height; Favourable conditions: Long winter nights, clear cloudless skies, calm dry air; Inversion types: Surface / Ground radiation inversion, Advectional inversion (warm air blowing over cold surface), Valley inversion (cold dense air draining down slopes into valley bottoms while thermal belts form on mid-slopes, preventing frost damage to orchards); Inversion impacts: Trapping urban air pollution and smog, radiation fog formation.', ARRAY['Temperature Inversion Reversal', 'Radiation Ground Inversion', 'Advectional Marine Inversion', 'Valley Air Drainage & Frost Pockets', 'Thermal Belts on Slopes', 'Smog Trapping Effects']::text[], ARRAY['Temperature', 'Inversion', 'Radiation', 'Advection', 'Valley', 'Belts', 'Reversal', 'normal', 'lapse', 'rate', 'where', 'temperature', 'increases', 'height', 'Favourable', 'conditions', 'Long', 'winter', 'nights', 'clear', 'cloudless', 'skies', 'calm', 'dry', 'air', 'types', 'Surface', 'Ground', 'radiation', 'inversion', 'Advectional', 'warm', 'blowing', 'over', 'cold', 'surface', 'dense', 'draining', 'down', 'slopes', 'into', 'valley', 'bottoms', 'while', 'thermal', 'belts', 'form', 'mid', 'preventing', 'frost', 'damage', 'orchards', 'impacts', 'Trapping', 'urban', 'pollution', 'smog', 'fog', 'formation', 'Marine', 'Air', 'Drainage', 'Frost', 'Pockets', 'Thermal', 'Slopes', 'Smog', 'Effects']::text[],
