        '[UPSC: Prelims-GS1, Mains-GS1] [KAS: Prelims-P1, Mains-GS1] [SSC: GA]', 'Seven global pressure belts: Thermal belts (Equatorial Low Pressure Belt / Doldrums / ITCZ, Polar Highs), Dynamic belts (Subtropical High Pressure Belts / Horse Latitudes at 30-35 deg, Subpolar Low Pressure Belts at 60-65 deg); Tricellular meridional circulation cells: Hadley Cell (tropical convection and subtropical subsidence), Ferrel Cell (mid-latitude indirect circulation), Polar Cell; Seasonal latitudinal migration of pressure belts tracking the apparent movement of the Sun.', ARRAY['Equatorial Low / ITCZ Doldrums', 'Subtropical High / Horse Latitudes', 'Subpolar Lows & Polar Highs', 'Hadley, Ferrel & Polar Cells', 'Pressure Belt Seasonal Shifting']::text[], ARRAY['Global', 'Pressure', 'Belts', 'Tricellular', 'Circulation', 'Hadley', 'Ferrel', 'Polar', 'Seven', 'global', 'pressure', 'belts', 'Thermal', 'Equatorial', 'Low', 'Belt', 'Doldrums', 'ITCZ', 'Highs', 'Dynamic', 'Subtropical', 'High', 'Horse', 'Latitudes', '30', '35', 'deg', 'Subpolar', '60', '65', 'meridional', 'circulation', 'cells', 'Cell', 'tropical', 'convection', 'subtropical', 'subsidence', 'mid', 'latitude', 'indirect', 'Seasonal', 'latitudinal', 'migration', 'tracking', 'apparent', 'movement', 'Sun', 'Lows', 'Cells', 'Shifting']::text[],
        'civil_services', ARRAY['civil_services']::text[]
