        '[UPSC: Prelims-GS1, Mains-GS1] [KAS: Prelims-P1, Mains-GS1] [SSC: GA]', 'Earth''s water distribution: 97.2% saline in oceans, 2.8% freshwater (68.7% in ice caps and glaciers, 30.1% in groundwater, 0.3% in lakes and rivers, 0.04% in atmosphere); Hydrological Cycle components: Evaporation, Transpiration (Evapotranspiration), Condensation, Precipitation, Infiltration, Percolation, Surface runoff, and Groundwater flow; Global water budget balancing ocean excess evaporation vs land excess precipitation.', ARRAY['Global Freshwater Distribution', 'Hydrological Cycle Mechanics', 'Evapotranspiration & Runoff', 'Infiltration and Percolation', 'Global Water Budget Equilibrium']::text[], ARRAY['Global', 'Hydrological', 'Cycle', 'Water', 'Budget', 'Earth', 'water', 'distribution', '97', '2%', 'saline', 'oceans', '8%', 'freshwater', '68', '7%', 'ice', 'caps', 'glaciers', '30', '1%', 'groundwater', '3%', 'lakes', 'rivers', '04%', 'atmosphere', 'components', 'Evaporation', 'Transpiration', 'Evapotranspiration', 'Condensation', 'Precipitation', 'Infiltration', 'Percolation', 'Surface', 'runoff', 'Groundwater', 'flow', 'budget', 'balancing', 'ocean', 'excess', 'evaporation', 'land', 'precipitation', 'Freshwater', 'Distribution', 'Mechanics', 'Runoff', 'Equilibrium']::text[],
