        '[UPSC: Prelims-GS1, Mains-GS1] [KAS: Prelims-P1, Mains-GS1] [SSC: GA]', 'Subsurface hydrology: Zone of aeration / Vadose zone (soil moisture, capillary fringe) vs Zone of saturation / Phreatic zone; Water Table (fluctuating upper limit of saturation); Porosity vs Permeability; Aquifers: Unconfined (water table aquifer), Confined / Artesian aquifer (trapped between impermeable aquitards/aquicludes under hydrostatic pressure, artesian wells); Perched water table; Natural springs and geysers (Old Faithful, geothermal groundwater heated by magma); Groundwater depletion, saltwater intrusion in coastal aquifers, and artificial recharge.', ARRAY['Water Table & Phreatic Zone', 'Vadose / Aeration Zone', 'Unconfined vs Confined Aquifers', 'Artesian Wells & Hydrostatic Pressure', 'Aquitards and Aquicludes', 'Groundwater Depletion & Recharge']::text[], ARRAY['Groundwater', 'Hydrology', 'Water', 'Table', 'Aquifers', 'Springs', 'Subsurface', 'hydrology', 'Zone', 'aeration', 'Vadose', 'zone', 'soil', 'moisture', 'capillary', 'fringe', 'saturation', 'Phreatic', 'fluctuating', 'upper', 'limit', 'Porosity', 'Permeability', 'Unconfined', 'water', 'table', 'aquifer', 'Confined', 'Artesian', 'trapped', 'between', 'impermeable', 'aquitards', 'aquicludes', 'under', 'hydrostatic', 'pressure', 'artesian', 'wells', 'Perched', 'Natural', 'springs', 'geysers', 'Old', 'Faithful', 'geothermal', 'groundwater', 'heated', 'magma', 'depletion', 'saltwater', 'intrusion', 'coastal', 'aquifers', 'artificial', 'recharge', 'Aeration', 'Wells', 'Hydrostatic', 'Pressure', 'Aquitards', 'Aquicludes', 'Depletion', 'Recharge']::text[],
