        '[UPSC: Prelims-GS1, Mains-GS1] [KAS: Prelims-P1, Mains-GS1] [SSC: GA]', 'Physicochemical stratification: Temperature profile: Warm epipelagic mixed layer, Thermocline (rapid temperature decline between 200m-1000m), Cold deep layer; Factors affecting surface temperature: Latitude, upwelling, ocean currents; Salinity: Global average 35 practical salinity units (psu or ‰), Halocline (rapid salinity gradient); Drivers: Evaporation, precipitation, river discharge, ice melting; High-salinity water bodies (Lake Van 330‰, Dead Sea 240‰, Great Salt Lake 220‰, Red Sea 41‰) vs Low-salinity bodies (Baltic Sea 2-7‰, Black Sea); Pycnocline (density stratification zone combining temperature and salinity).', ARRAY['Thermocline Temperature Layering', 'Halocline Salinity Stratification', 'Pycnocline Density Zone', 'Average Ocean Salinity (35‰)', 'High Salinity Seas (Red Sea, Dead Sea)', 'Low Salinity Seas (Baltic Sea)']::text[], ARRAY['Ocean', 'Temperature', 'Salinity', 'Density', 'Profiles', 'Thermocline', 'Halocline', 'Physicochemical', 'stratification', 'profile', 'Warm', 'epipelagic', 'mixed', 'layer', 'rapid', 'temperature', 'decline', 'between', '200m', '1000m', 'Cold', 'deep', 'Factors', 'affecting', 'surface', 'Latitude', 'upwelling', 'ocean', 'currents', 'Global', 'average', '35', 'practical', 'salinity', 'units', 'psu', 'gradient', 'Drivers', 'Evaporation', 'precipitation', 'river', 'discharge', 'ice', 'melting', 'High', 'water', 'bodies', 'Lake', 'Van', '330', 'Dead', 'Sea', '240', 'Great', 'Salt', '220', 'Red', '41', 'Low', 'Baltic', 'Black', 'Pycnocline', 'density', 'zone', 'combining', 'Layering', 'Stratification', 'Zone', 'Average', 'Seas']::text[],
