        '[UPSC: Prelims-GS1, Mains-GS1] [KAS: Prelims-P1, Mains-GS1] [SSC: GA]', 'Coupled ocean-atmosphere teleconnections: Normal Walker Circulation over equatorial Pacific; El Niño Southern Oscillation (ENSO): El Niño warm phase (weakening of Trade winds, eastward displacement of warm water pool, suppression of Peruvian coastal upwelling, collapse of anchovy fishery, teleconnections suppressing Indian monsoon and causing Australian drought); La Niña cold phase (intensified Trade winds, amplified Peruvian upwelling, enhanced monsoon rainfall in India); El Niño Modoki (central Pacific warming anomaly); Indian Ocean Dipole (IOD): Positive IOD (warm Western Indian Ocean, cool Eastern Indian Ocean, favorable for Indian monsoon) vs Negative IOD (cool Western Indian Ocean, suppressed monsoon); ENSO-IOD coupling and global climatic anomalies.', ARRAY['Walker Circulation Cell', 'El Niño (ENSO Warm Phase)', 'La Niña (ENSO Cold Phase)', 'Southern Oscillation Index (SOI)', 'El Niño Modoki', 'Indian Ocean Dipole (Positive & Negative IOD)', 'Peruvian Upwelling Suppression', 'Teleconnections to Indian Monsoon']::text[], ARRAY['Ocean', 'Atmosphere', 'Teleconnections', 'ENSO', 'Indian', 'Dipole', 'Coupled', 'ocean', 'atmosphere', 'teleconnections', 'Normal', 'Walker', 'Circulation', 'over', 'equatorial', 'Pacific', 'El', 'Ni', 'Southern', 'Oscillation', 'warm', 'phase', 'weakening', 'Trade', 'winds', 'eastward', 'displacement', 'water', 'pool', 'suppression', 'Peruvian', 'coastal', 'upwelling', 'collapse', 'anchovy', 'fishery', 'suppressing', 'monsoon', 'causing', 'Australian', 'drought', 'La', 'cold', 'intensified', 'amplified', 'enhanced', 'rainfall', 'India', 'Modoki', 'central', 'warming', 'anomaly', 'IOD', 'Positive', 'Western', 'cool', 'Eastern', 'favorable', 'Negative', 'suppressed', 'coupling', 'global', 'climatic', 'anomalies', 'Cell', 'Warm', 'Phase', 'Cold', 'Index', 'SOI', 'Upwelling', 'Suppression', 'Monsoon']::text[],
