        'Subtopic_Entity', 'Geography & Earth Systems', 'geography_earth_systems', 'geography_earth_systems.economic_resource_geography.location_factors_of_primary_secondary_tertiary_industries',
        ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY['geography_earth_systems', 'geography_earth_systems.economic_resource_geography', 'geography_earth_systems.economic_resource_geography.location_factors_of_primary_secondary_tertiary_industries']::text[], '{"upsc": ["Prelims-GS1", "Mains-GS1"], "kas": ["Prelims-P1", "Mains-GS1"], "ssc": ["GA"]}'::jsonb,
        '[UPSC: Prelims-GS1, Mains-GS1] [KAS: Prelims-P1, Mains-GS1] [SSC: GA]', 'Post-industrial economic geography and service clustering: Footloose Industries (industries with no specific raw material or market weight bias, negligible transport costs relative to value, highly dependent on component interchangeability, precision engineering, electronics assembly); Information Technology (IT) and Software Services (agglomeration driven by human capital, educational ecosystems, telecommunications infrastructure, venture capital, and airport connectivity; Major Indian IT corridors: Bengaluru ''Silicon Valley of India'', Hyderabad ''Cyberabad'', Pune Hinjawadi, Chennai OMR corridor, Delhi-NCR Gurgaon/Noida; Global tech clusters: Silicon Valley California, Route 128 Boston, Shenzhen hardware capital); Global Capability Centers (GCCs), semiconductor fabrication geography, and biotechnology hubs (Genome Valley Hyderabad).', ARRAY['Footloose Industry Concept', 'IT Corridors (Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Pune)', 'Silicon Valley & Global Tech Hubs', 'Semiconductor Fabrication Geography', 'Global Capability Centers (GCCs)', 'Biotechnology Parks (Genome Valley)']::text[], ARRAY['Footloose', 'Knowledge', 'Based', 'High', 'Tech', 'IT', 'Corridors', 'Post', 'industrial', 'economic', 'geography', 'service', 'clustering', 'Industries', 'industries', 'no', 'specific', 'raw', 'material', 'market', 'weight', 'bias', 'negligible', 'transport', 'costs', 'relative', 'value', 'highly', 'dependent', 'component', 'interchangeability', 'precision', 'engineering', 'electronics', 'assembly', 'Information', 'Technology', 'Software', 'Services', 'agglomeration', 'driven', 'human', 'capital', 'educational', 'ecosystems', 'telecommunications', 'infrastructure', 'venture', 'airport', 'connectivity', 'Major', 'Indian', 'corridors', 'Bengaluru', 'Silicon', 'Valley', 'India', 'Hyderabad', 'Cyberabad', 'Pune', 'Hinjawadi', 'Chennai', 'OMR', 'corridor', 'Delhi', 'NCR', 'Gurgaon', 'Noida', 'Global', 'tech', 'c